# Mutation plan for enable, disable and remove on the Rust plugin host, saved through Go.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-toggle.plan
#
# CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.
#
# 2026-09-18: 10 run, 8 caught; the control survived. toggle-no-reload SURVIVED as an equivalent
# mutant over HTTP: mm_api's refresh_config_after_write reloads after every write request before
# the response leaves, so the activation happens before the client hears either way. The app-level
# reload stays for callers inside the app (RemovePlugin's disable).

